632: 	bool "Add RCVTIMEO support to net_context"
633: 	help
634: 	  It is possible to time out receiving a network packet. The timeout
635: 	  time is configurable run-time in the application code. For network
636: 	  sockets timeout is configured per socket with
637: 	  setsockopt(sock, SOL_SOCKET, SO_RCVTIMEO, ...) function.
